hitecture Pathways for mature-age students <p> If you will be aged 20 years or older on 1 March (for Semester 1 entry) or 1 August (for Semester 2 entry) you qualify for our mature-age-entry pathways. </p> Architecture Pathways for mature-age students <!-- RichTextCourseCard.cshtml --> ADMISSION REQUIREMENT English competency <p>English is the language of instruction and assessment at UWA and you will need to meet the <a href="https://www.uwa.edu.au/study/how-to-apply/english-language-requirements">English language requirements</a> of the University to be eligible for a place.</p> <p>Minimum overall IELTS score of 6.5, with no band less than 6.0.</p> ADMISSION REQUIREMENT English competency',
