    course_description = '<p>Asia is home to two-thirds of the world''s population and some of the most dynamic and fascinating societies on the planet. It’s also an economic powerhouse that is vital to Australia''s future prosperity and security. <br/> <br/> Asian Studies provides knowledge and a solid basis for critically understanding the great diversity of cultures, societies and political systems of Asia. <br/> <br/> Our popular in-country study options give you a golden opportunity to directly experience life in China, Japan, Korea or Indonesia and boost your resume. <br/> <br/> Combining Asian Studies with an Asian language major of your choice equips you with the cultural literacy that is increasingly sought after by employers both in government and the private sector. <br/> </p>',
