/li> </ul> <a href="https://www.uwa.edu.au/study/How-to-apply/International-and-overseas-qualifications/us-college-board-ap-examinations">US College Board Advanced Placements</a> <ul> <li>13</li> </ul> <a href="https://www.uwa.edu.au/study/How-to-apply/International-and-overseas-qualifications/US-college-board-SAT-and-ACT">US College Board SAT </a> <ul> <li>1270</li> </ul> Western Australian Universities'' Foundation Program (WAUFP) <ul> <li>70</li> </ul> Western Australian Certificate of Education (WACE) 2016 onwards <ul> <li>90</li> </ul> <p> <a href="#8c8954d2-aafd-4b82-b7f1-4e72f96c823e">View full details</a> </p> <!-- RichTextCourseCard.cshtml --> ADMISSION REQUIREMENT English competency <p>English is the language of instruction and assessment at UWA and you will need to meet the <a href="https://www.uwa.edu.au/study/how-to-apply/english-language-requirements">English language requirements</a> of the University to be eligible for a place.</p> <p>Minimum overall IELTS score of 6.5, with no band less than 6.0.</p> ADMISSION REQUIREMENT English competency <!-- RichTextCourseCard.cshtml --> Prerequisites <p><strong>This major requires:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Mathematics Methods ATAR; OR </li> <li>Mathematics Applications ATAR with a mathematics unit taken in the first year; OR </li> <li>Students without ATAR mathematics to take two mathematics units in their first year. </li> <br/> <li>Chemistry ATAR or an additional chemistry unit taken in the first year.</li> <br/> </ul> Prerequisites',
