UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p>You''ll undertake a combination of units (core and option), covering diverse topics from development economics to environmental sciences, food and agriculture, governance and non-government organisations (NGOs), public health, and law and policy.</p> <p>A key component of the Master of International Development focuses on regional development in Western Australia, introducing you to the development challenges faced by Australia, including its remote Indigenous communities.</p> <p>The Master of International Development can be taken either as a ''Coursework only'', or a ''Coursework and Dissertation'', degree. If you choose the Dissertation you''ll work with one of UWA''s world-leading experts to research a specialist subject of their choosing.</p>',
