UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p>This course is for students who have completed undergraduate studies in engineering. You''ll specialise in a program of engineering and undertake advanced engineering technical units, professional units, design and research projects, and undertake a 12-week professional practicum. Beyond practice as a professional engineer, you''ll pursue further research studies in engineering, as well as seek employment in a wide range of related industries. </p> <p><strong>The following specialisations are available:</strong> <br/> Automation and Robotics Engineering<br/> Biomedical Engineering<br/> Chemical Engineering<br/> Civil Engineering<br/> Electrical and Electronic Engineering<br/> Environmental Engineering<br/> Mechanical Engineering<br/> Mining Engineering<br/> Software Engineering</p> <p>Upon successful completion, you''ll have an internationally recognised qualification that allows you to practise as a professional engineer.</p>',
